    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Welcome young mage!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'You have entered my Atelier of Arcane Arts, a place where the magic
        of the Weave is studied

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Follow me downstairs and I will show you how to  learn new spells and
        brew potions!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: TELEPORT!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'thirdLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: this is the training area, here you can use what you have learned.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'thirdLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: There are three trials, when a trial ends you will be teleported here
        again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'thirdLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'there is more than one way to complete a trial, you need to find all
        of them to complete it. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1403216877693906484, guid: 04d1af40dc4471d4585b211039442679, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'thirdLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Bring me the treasures and you will become a lvl 1 mage!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
